 questions about their profound impact on society.", "catalogBreadth": null, "catalogDistr": null, "catalogEnrollmentPriority": "", "catalogLang": null, "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": null, "catalogAttribute": null, "catalogWhenOffered": null, "catalogComments": null, "catalogPrereqCoreq": null, "catalogPrereq": "", "catalogCoreq": "", "catalogFee": null, "catalogSatisfiesReq": null, "catalogPermission": null, "catalogCourseSubfield": null, "catalogOutcomes": ["Analyze and critique the complex information society around them.", "Students will be able describe how the socio-economic and cultural environment is changing with economic environment are changing with the emergence of new media and digital technologies.", "Students will be able to identify, describe, and speak about pressing contemporary controversies around new media (e.g., privacy,relationships, expertise, content moderation.", "Students will be able to articulate their perspective on these issues, in relevant digital media formats."], "acadCareer": "UG", "acadGroup": "EN", "catalogName": null, "catalogNextOffered": null, "lastTermsOffered": "2026SU, 2026SP, 2025SU, 2025SP", "catalogCredits": null, "catalogGradeOption": null, "catalogLocation": null, "catalogCrosslisted": null, "catalogCrosslistings": null, "catalogComeets": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": []}, {"strm": 2930, "crseId": 373028, "crseOfferNbr": 1, "subject": "INFO", "catalogNbr": "3312", "titleShort": "Data Communication", "titleLong": "Data Communication", "crseAttrs": [{"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "DLG-AG", "descr": "AG-Data Literacy, General", "descrformal": "AG-Data Literacy, General", "attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "attrDescrShort": "DistReq"}, {"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "OPHLS-AG", "descr": "AG-Other Physcl & Life Sci Req", "descrformal": "AG-Other Physical and Life Sciences Requirement", "attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "attrDescrShort": "DistReq"}, {"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "SDS-AS", "de